From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UniFrog CI <ci@unifrog.local>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 07:19:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Harden PICO-8 print control parsing

Validate every control-sequence operand before advancing through the string, bound emulated RAM writes, remove the unused fixed-size audio buffer, prevent zero-width tab modulo operations, and restore the solid-background disable selector.
---
 source/printHelper.cpp | 61 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 43 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/source/printHelper.cpp b/source/printHelper.cpp
index 2b423a97067b0012ed2ff5cea132b5370cb8201b..aa4d4e0f9e435bc3d4e7b7df36f1910ab98f75e6 100644
--- a/source/printHelper.cpp
+++ b/source/printHelper.cpp
@@ -1,9 +1,9 @@
+#include <algorithm>
 #include <string>
 
 #include "printHelper.h"
 #include "nibblehelpers.h"
 
-#include <string>
 #include "graphics.h"
 #include "vm.h"
 #include "Audio.h"
